# The Drowned Gate's two culverts (CIPlay drowned_gate_caves, 11-12 w09; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the
# recipe: culvert 1's mouth on the outer floor at 45 -22 (4 m down), climbing at 12 degrees (yaw 180) to the divers'
# store round 45 -66 (air zone dg_diversstore, the divers' kit at 46.2 -73.5); culvert 2 (kit 20 -5) climbing
# yaw 200 to the pump sump round 6 -45. Walks along the floor as weatherglass_deep_caves (11-12: swims stuck on the mouth pieces).
island The Drowned Gate keep
offset 2.5038 -5.1355
hour 11
weather Calm
empty

# Culvert 1: walk in along the floor (under the sea, as weatherglass_deep_caves), up out of the water to the divers' store
picture dg_cave_out 46 -1.0 -12 45.5 -2.5 -22 light=20
walk 45 -17 to 45 -22 to 45 -32 to 45 -42 to 45 -52 to 45 -62 to 45 -69 below=0
air dg_diversstore here
picture dg_cave_in 45 8.0 -64.5 45.8 7.0 -74 light=20
open Divers' kit
wait 2
expect item Battery 2
walk 45 -69 to 45 -60 to 45 -50 to 45 -40 to 45 -30 below=7.5

# Culvert 2: from the sea floor outside the mouth, along the kit line up the culvert into the pump sump room
# (11-12 fix2: the culverts' hill moves the land centre - offset 2.5038 -5.1355, not the old -0.4723 -0.419; the
# '3.6 m to the side' seen before was that 3 m / 4.7 m shift)
walk 23.08 0.28 to 21.18 -4.12 to 19.08 -9.72 to 16.38 -17.22 to 12.88 -26.72 to 9.58 -36.02 to 7.08 -42.72 to 4.98 -46.72 below=-3
picture dg_sump 3.98 6.6 -49.22 11.38 2.0 -28.72 light=20
walk 4.98 -46.72 to 7.08 -42.72 to 9.58 -36.02 to 12.88 -26.72 to 16.38 -17.22 below=7.5
